+# WIRE.md
+
+## `codex-api/src/`
+
+- `codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs` — maps wire-level API and transport errors into protocol errors, including overload, retry-delay, policy, and HTTP status cases; `codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs:21`
+- `codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs` — tests API-to-protocol error mapping for overload, retry delays, transport bodies, and user-facing messages; `codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs:8`
+- `codex-api/src/auth.rs` — defines the outbound-request authentication provider interface, header resolution, request application, and auth telemetry; `codex-api/src/auth.rs:30`
+- `codex-api/src/common.rs` — defines Responses request/response wire payloads, common request controls, streaming events, trace metadata, and the public response stream; `codex-api/src/common.rs:275`
+- `codex-api/src/error.rs` — defines the crate-wide API error taxonomy, from transport/status failures to quota, rate-limit, policy, and overload errors; `codex-api/src/error.rs:9`
+- `codex-api/src/files.rs` — handles hosted OpenAI file creation, streaming upload, finalization, limits, and upload result types; `codex-api/src/files.rs:121`
+- `codex-api/src/images.rs` — serializes image generation/edit requests and deserializes image responses and payload settings; `codex-api/src/images.rs:5`
+- `codex-api/src/lib.rs` — declares the crate's modules and re-exports its public wire, client, provider, search, and image APIs; `codex-api/src/lib.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/provider.rs` — models provider endpoint configuration, retry policy, wire protocol choice, and HTTP/WS URL construction; `codex-api/src/provider.rs:56`
+- `codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs` — parses rate-limit headers, limit windows, credits, plan state, and promo messages into snapshots; `codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs:57`
+- `codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs` — extracts safety-buffering treatment and faster-model fallback information from response headers; `codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs:8`
+- `codex-api/src/search.rs` — defines search tool requests, operations, filters, locations, settings, and response payloads; `codex-api/src/search.rs:9`
+- `codex-api/src/telemetry.rs` — wraps unary, SSE, and WebSocket request execution with retry-aware request telemetry hooks; `codex-api/src/telemetry.rs:68`
+
+## `codex-api/src/endpoint/`
+
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs` — posts compaction requests to `responses/compact`, captures turn state, and parses compacted response items; `codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs:39`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs` — posts image generation and edit requests, captures request IDs, and parses image responses; `codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs:35`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs` — posts memory summarization inputs to `memories/trace_summarize` and parses summarized outputs; `codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs:36`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs` — exposes the endpoint clients and realtime wire types through the crate API; `codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs` — requests and decodes available model metadata, returning models and the response ETag; `codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs:46`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs` — creates WebRTC realtime calls by posting SDP and session payloads and decoding SDP and call IDs; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs:129`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs` — streams Responses inference requests, translates Chat-only request bodies, adds session headers, and selects compression; `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs:112`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs` — connects to Responses WebSocket endpoints, sends response-create frames, probes handshakes, and maps WS events into response streams; `codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs:397`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs` — serializes search requests, posts them to `alpha/search`, and decodes search responses; `codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs:35`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs` — provides the shared HTTP endpoint session that builds, authorizes, retries, sends, and maps endpoint requests; `codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs:80`
+
+## `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/`
+
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs` — implements realtime WebSocket connections, event pumps, outbound writers, transcript state, and session setup; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs:791`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs` — dispatches outbound realtime messages by V1, Frameless Bidi, or V2 wire adapter; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs:41`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs` — tests common outbound message dispatch across realtime wire adapters; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs:16`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs` — builds frameless context appends, session updates, initial items, and bounded content chunks; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs:25`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — tests frameless context chunk limits and session JSON encoding; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:11`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs` — builds V1 realtime conversation, handoff, and Quicksilver session-update messages; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs:18`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs` — builds V2 realtime conversation, tool-output, and session-update messages with modalities and tools; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs:39`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs` — assembles realtime method and protocol modules and re-exports their public wire types; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs` — defines realtime adapters, session configuration, outbound messages, and dispatches payload parsing; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs:263`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs` — provides shared realtime payload parsing for session updates, transcript deltas/dones, and errors; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs:27`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs` — parses Frameless Bidi session, audio, transcript, turn, delegation, and error events; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs:15`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — tests Frameless Bidi event parsing against legacy handoffs and internal event types; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:7`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs` — parses V1 realtime session, audio, transcript, item, handoff, and error events; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs:12`
+- `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs` — parses V2 realtime response, audio, transcript, item, speech, handoff, no-op, and error events; `codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs:24`
+
+## `codex-api/src/requests/`
+
+- `codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs` — translates Responses API requests into OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions bodies; `codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs:19`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs` — builds session headers, derives subagent headers, and inserts validated HTTP headers; `codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs:5`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs` — groups request-translation modules and exports the compression setting; `codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs` — defines the optional none/zstd request compression mode; `codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs:1`
+
+## `codex-api/src/sse/`
+
+- `codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs` — groups SSE translators and exports Chat and Responses stream adapters; `codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs:1`
+- `codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs` — translates Chat Completions SSE deltas into normalized Responses-style response events; `codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs:30`
+- `codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs` — parses Responses SSE events and headers into response events, rate limits, model state, and turn state; `codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs:36`

